will be the only two returning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_7","text":"You, however, will remain as one of our citizens, so we will continue to keep watch over you.","jump":"d_counseling_crown_04_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_8","text":"Very good. That is the answer I was looking for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_9","text":"However, do not be upset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_10","text":"You can join us anytime, should you wish.","jump":"d_counseling_crown_04_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_11","text":"Always. Never forget that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_crown_04_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_crown_04_12","text":"All of us speculate about when Crown might return to the kingdom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie